      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 21 · AI Shipping Automation\nInterprets carrier tracking events, writes customer-friendly status updates and flags delays or exceptions.\n\n**Trigger:** `POST /webhook/shipping-automation` (JSON body)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Gmail OAuth2, OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate.\n\n**Sample payload:**\n```json\n{\n \"order_id\": \"ORD-5531\",\n \"customer_email\": \"buyer@example.com\",\n \"carrier\": \"BlueDart\",\n \"event\": \"Delivery attempt failed - customer not available\",\n \"eta\": \"2026-11-12\"\n}\n```"
      }
